# apps/api

- Fastify on `API_PORT` (3001). Hocuspocus `collabServer` on `COLLAB_PORT` (1234) in the same process.
- Auth: better-auth at `/api/auth/*`, cookie session. Host of a room = `session.user.id === rooms.hostUserId`.
- Guest: valid `invite_token` query/body. No guest rows in MySQL.
- HTTP: `GET/POST /api/rooms`, `GET /api/rooms/:slug`, `GET /api/health`.
- WS: `GET /ws/runtime` (shared console), `GET /ws/integrity` (host receives snapshots only; guest sends events).
- Yjs document name = room `slug`. Persist `rooms.yjs_state`. Seed default files in `workspace.ts`.
- Schema changes: `apps/api/src/db/schema.ts` then `pnpm db:push`. Tables: better-auth user/session/account, `rooms`, `runs`, `integrity_events`.
- Integrity: persist `message` + small JSON `payload`. Never store pasted source. On guest socket close, emit `offline`.
- Run: read files from the live Y.Doc, one job per room, POST to runner. Do not call Piston.
- Env from repo-root `.env` via `env.ts`. CORS `WEB_ORIGIN` with credentials.
